<title>RUSSIA: Rouble rises to 3,567.99 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble rises to 3,567.99 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble rose to 3,567.99 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,592.99 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 11		 Sept 10</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,567.99		3,592.99</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    0.54		    3.03</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
